  "releaseNotes": "v1.8.6 - Builder Pattern and ORM Hardening: [NEW] IQueryBuilder, IQuerySyncBuilder, IQueryPaginatedBuilder with fluent API; [NEW] OrderBy/OrderByDescending with params string[]; [NEW] GroupBy with aggregates support; [NEW] Paginate() on IQueryPaginatedBuilder; [NEW] ToList() on IQuerySyncBuilder and IQueryPaginatedBuilder; [NEW] GuidStringHandler centralized with EnsureRegistered(); [NEW] Enum values serialized as int; [FIX] FillComposition cycle detection by entity identity (type + PK) prevents infinite recursion on circular RelatedEntity references; [FIX] FillComposition OneToMany null guard when FK not resolvable; [FIX] DataBaseConnection.Dispose transaction-before-connection order with uncommitted transaction rollback safety; [FIX] Transaction Dispose prevents database locks; [FIX] Disconnect with Dispose and connection null; [FIX] PersistComposition always disconnects after commit; [FIX] FillComposition recursion support; [FIX] ParseComposition supports ReadOnlyCollection; [FIX] Enum to int conversion; [FIX] BaseEntity default constructor sets CreatedAt; [PERF] EntityPropsCache - cached filtered PropertyInfo[] per entity type; [PERF] ColumnMappingCache for sort/group SQL generation; [PERF] SQL Dump only in DEBUG builds",
